<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>FactZone - Amazing Facts</title>

    <!-- Attractive Google Font -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: "Poppins", sans-serif;
            color: white;

            /* 🌌 Attractive background */
            background:
                radial-gradient(circle at 20% 20%, #4f46e5 0%, transparent 25%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 80% 30%, #9333ea 0%, transparent 25%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 50% 90%, #0ea5e9 0%, transparent 25%),
                #080b18;

            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        /* HEADER */
        header {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 55px 20px 35px;
        }

        header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: clamp(42px, 10vw, 70px);
            font-weight: 800;

            background: linear-gradient(
                90deg,
                #60a5fa,
                #c084fc,
                #f0abfc
            );

            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            color: transparent;

            text-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.4);
        }

        header p {
            margin-top: 10px;
            color: #cbd5e1;
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        /* NAVIGATION */
        nav {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 10px;
            padding: 15px;
        }

        nav a {
            color: #e2e8f0;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 9px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
            color: white;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        /* SEARCH */
        .search {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .search input {
            width: min(90%, 600px);
            padding: 17px 22px;

            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
            border-radius: 30px;

            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            backdrop-filter: blur(15px);

            color: white;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-family: "Poppins", sans-serif;

            outline: none;

            box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
        }

        .search input::placeholder {
            color: #cbd5e1;
        }

        .search input:focus {
            border-color: #a78bfa;
            box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(167,139,250,0.35);
        }

        /* FACT CONTAINER */
        .container {
            max-width: 950px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 15px 20px 50px;
        }

        /* FACT CARD */
        .fact {
            margin: 22px 0;
            padding: 25px;

            border-radius: 22px;

            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.13);

            backdrop-filter: blur(15px);

            box-shadow:
                0 10px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);

            transition: 0.35s ease;

            animation: appear 0.7s ease;
        }

        .fact:hover {
            transform: translateY(-7px) scale(1.01);

            box-shadow:
                0 15px 45px rgba(139,92,246,0.25);

            border-color: rgba(196,181,253,0.4);
        }

        .fact h2 {
            margin: 8px 0;
            font-size: 24px;
        }

        .fact p {
            color: #dbeafe;
            line-height: 1.7;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        /* CATEGORY */
        .category {
            display: inline-block;

            padding: 5px 12px;
            border-radius: 20px;

            background: rgba(139,92,246,0.2);
            color: #c4b5fd;

            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        /* FOOTER */
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 25px;

            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);

            color: #94a3b8;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        /* ANIMATION */
        @keyframes appear {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(20px);
            }

            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        /* MOBILE */
        @media (max-width: 600px) {

            header {
                padding-top: 40px;
            }

            header p {
                font-size: 15px;
            }

            .fact {
                padding: 20px;
            }

            .fact h2 {
                font-size: 21px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <header>
        <h1>🧠 FactZone</h1>
        <p>Discover • Learn • Be Amazed</p>
    </header>

    <nav>
        <a href="#">🏠 Home</a>
        <a href="#">🌌 Space</a>
        <a href="#">🐾 Animals</a>
        <a href="#">🔬 Science</a>
        <a href="#">🌍 Earth</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="search">
        <input
            type="text"
            id="searchBox"
            placeholder="🔍 Search amazing facts..."
            onkeyup="searchFacts()"
        >
    </div>

    <div class="container">

        <div class="fact">
            <span class="category">🌌 SPACE</span>
            <h2>Fact #1</h2>
            <p>A day on Venus is longer than a year on Venus.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="fact">
            <span class="category">🐙 ANIMALS</span>
            <h2>Fact #2</h2>
            <p>Octopuses have three hearts.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="fact">
            <span class="category">🦈 ANIMALS</span>
            <h2>Fact #3</h2>
            <p>Sharks have existed on Earth for hundreds of millions of years.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="fact">
            <span class="category">🌍 EARTH</span>
            <h2>Fact #4</h2>
            <p>Earth is the only known planet with large amounts of liquid water on its surface.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="fact">
            <span class="category">☀️ SPACE</span>
            <h2>Fact #5</h2>
            <p>The Sun contains more than 99% of the mass of the Solar System.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="fact">
            <span class="category">🐝 ANIMALS</span>
            <h2>Fact #6</h2>
            <p>Honeybees communicate using a movement called the waggle dance.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="fact">
            <span class="category">🪐 SPACE</span>
            <h2>Fact #7</h2>
            <p>Saturn is less dense than water.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="fact">
            <span class="category">🦒 ANIMALS</span>
            <h2>Fact #8</h2>
            <p>Giraffes have seven neck vertebrae, the same number as humans.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="fact">
            <span class="category">🌙 SPACE</span>
            <h2>Fact #9</h2>
            <p>The Moon is Earth's natural satellite.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="fact">
            <span class="category">🧊 SCIENCE</span>
            <h2>Fact #10</h2>
            <p>Water expands when it freezes, which is why ice floats.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="fact">
            <span class="category">🐘 ANIMALS</span>
            <h2>Fact #11</h2>
            <p>Elephants can communicate using sounds that humans cannot easily hear.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="fact">
            <span class="category">⚡ SCIENCE</span>
            <h2>Fact #12</h2>
            <p>Lightning can heat the surrounding air to extremely high temperatures.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="fact">
            <span class="category">🌳 NATURE</span>
            <h2>Fact #13</h2>
            <p>Trees release oxygen as a result of photosynthesis.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="fact">
            <span class="category">🦋 ANIMALS</span>
            <h2>Fact #14</h2>
            <p>Butterflies taste using receptors on their feet.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="fact">
            <span class="category">🔴 SPACE</span>
            <h2>Fact #15</h2>
            <p>Mars appears red because iron minerals on its surface have oxidized.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="fact">
            <span class="category">🧬 HUMAN BODY</span>
            <h2>Fact #16</h2>
            <p>The human body contains trillions of cells.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="fact">
            <span class="category">🌊 OCEAN</span>
            <h2>Fact #17</h2>
            <p>Most of Earth's ocean is deeper than 3,000 meters.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="fact">
            <span class="category">🐧 ANIMALS</span>
            <h2>Fact #18</h2>
            <p>Penguins are birds, but they cannot fly through the air.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="fact">
            <span class="category">💎 SCIENCE</span>
            <h2>Fact #19</h2>
            <p>Diamond and graphite are both made of carbon, but their atoms are arranged differently.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="fact">
            <span class="category">🌌 SPACE</span>
            <h2>Fact #20</h2>
            <p>There are billions of galaxies in the observable universe.</p>
        </div>

    </div>

    <footer>
        © 2026 FactZone • Keep Exploring 🚀
    </footer>

    <script>
        function searchFacts() {

            let input =
                document.getElementById("searchBox")
                .value.toLowerCase();

            let facts =
                document.getElementsByClassName("fact");

            for (let i = 0; i < facts.length; i++) {

                let text =
                    facts[i].innerText.toLowerCase();

                if (text.includes(input)) {
                    facts[i].style.display = "block";
                } else {
                    facts[i].style.display = "none";
                }
            }
        }
    </script>

</body>
</html>
